  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "Your H100 GPU is a Ferrari stuck in gridlock, wasting cycles waiting for memory access.",
      "visual_focus": "A high-speed GPU chip glowing red, then dimming to a crawl.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "wasting cycles": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "HBM Latency",
        "action_verb": "strangles",
        "direct_object": "Compute Throughput",
        "anchor_word": "gridlock",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "horizontal_race_bars",
        "title": "THE COMPUTE WALL",
        "sub": "Memory bandwidth is the ultimate killer.",
        "accent_color": "#EF4444",
        "params": {}
      },
      "thriller_role": "pattern_interrupt_hook",
      "act": 1
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "The villain is HBM latency. It forces your compute units to stop and beg for data, like a relay runner waiting for a baton.",
      "visual_focus": "A split screen showing a processor idle while a memory bar fills slowly.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "beg for data": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "HBM",
        "action_verb": "starves",
        "direct_object": "Tensor Cores",
        "anchor_word": "latency",
        "semantic_role": "problem_definition"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "grid_memory",
        "title": "THE RELAY BOTTLENECK",
        "sub": "Waiting for the baton.",
        "accent_color": "#EF4444",
        "params": {
          "grid_title": "Attention Matrix Buffer",
          "active_cell_label": "Blocked Block",
          "efficiency_label": "100% Latency Penalty"
        }
      },
      "thriller_role": "the_villain_bottleneck",
      "act": 2
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "FlashAttention-3 pivots to asynchronous kernel overlap. It stops the waiting game by interleaving memory transfers with active matrix math.",
      "visual_focus": "Two parallel streams of data merging into a single fluid motion.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "asynchronous kernel overlap": "#22C55E"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "FlashAttention-3",
        "action_verb": "obliterates",
        "direct_object": "Idle Time",
        "anchor_word": "overlap",
        "semantic_role": "solution_discovery"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "split_flow",
        "title": "ASYNCHRONOUS OVERLAP",
        "sub": "Compute and memory in lockstep.",
        "accent_color": "#34D399",
        "params": {
          "input_label": "Input Stream",
          "router_label": "Asynchronous Controller",
          "branch_a_label": "Copy Engine (DMA)",
          "branch_b_label": "Tensor Core (Compute)"
        }
      },
      "thriller_role": "eureka_pivot",
      "act": 3
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "It leverages TMA units to fetch the next block while the current one computes, effectively hiding latency behind the math.",
      "visual_focus": "A diagram of Tensor Memory Accelerator units moving data blocks.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "TMA units": "#22C55E"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "TMA",
        "action_verb": "hides",
        "direct_object": "Latency",
        "anchor_word": "fetch",
        "semantic_role": "technical_mechanism"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "neural_activation_wave",
        "title": "TMA PIPELINING",
        "sub": "Pre-fetching data blocks.",
        "accent_color": "#F59E0B",
        "params": {
          "input_label": "FP8 Data",
          "hidden_label": "Block-Level Scheduler",
          "output_label": "Max TFLOPS"
        }
      },
      "thriller_role": "technical_secret_sauce",
      "act": 3
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "The result? A massive 1,180 TFLOPS, achieving a 78% efficiency gain over the previous generation's architecture.",
